## Real-World Examples

### Example 1: CI/CD Pipeline - Run all tests in parallel, headless
```bash
cross-env CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

### Example 2: Local Development - Run @smoke tests in headed mode for debugging
```bash
npm run test:tags:headed
# Or with custom tag:
cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@debug" npm test
```

### Example 3: Run regression suite excluding work-in-progress
```bash
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression and not @wip" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

### Example 4: Run critical tests with full logging/tracing
```bash
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" TRACE=all HEADED=true npm test
```

