## Environment Variable Reference

| Variable | Values | Default | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|---------|
| `HEADED` | `true` / `false` | `false` | Show/hide browser window |
| `CUCUMBER_TAGS` | Tag expression | Empty | Filter scenarios by tags |
| `CUCUMBER_WORKERS` | `0` or number | `0` | Parallel worker count (0=serial) |
| `TRACE` | `all` or any | Not set | Collect traces for all scenarios |

